  "original_lyrics": "[verse]\nI like to go out every now and then\nI can't wait to do it again\n\n[bridge]\nI like to step out every once in while\nI kind of like to do it in style\nI haven't had the time, lately\nN..\nLately I've been staying at home (Staying at home, staying at home)\nWorking the crosswords turn off the phone (turn off the phone, turn off the phone)\nAnd I dream I'm on vacation, cause I like the way that sounds\nIt's the perfect occupation for me\nI don't mind being by myself if there's no one else around\nIt's the last good time, in town\nWell I could stand up straight, get real job\nStay out late with the same old mob\n\n[bridge]\nPut on suit, work downtown\nMoon come up and the sun go down,\nNo I haven't had the time, lately\nN..\nLately I've been staying at home (Staying at home, staying at home)\n\n[chorus]\nAnd I dream I'm on vacation, Though you won't see me around\nIt's perfect situation, for me\nI don't mind being by myself cause I know you'll come on down\nIt's the last good time, in town\nN..\nLately I've been staying at home (Staying at home, staying at home)\nWorking the crosswords turn off the phone (turn off the phone, turn off the phone)\nAnd I dream I'm on vacation, cause I like the way that sounds\nIt's the perfect occupation for me\nI don't mind being by myself if if you don't see me around\nIt's the last good time, in town",
